# Archive directories excluded from default search. They remain readable
# by direct path and searchable with ripgrep via --no-ignore.
agents/archive/
docs/archive/
research/archive/

# Sealed material (answer keys, TEST/held-out split files and rows derived from
# them) is hidden from default agent searches (rg, fd, OMP grep/glob) so a broad
# search cannot put it into a model's context. This is NOT an access control:
# direct path reads, git and `rg --no-ignore` still reach it. `evallab.governance
# check` fails when a tracked sealed path is not matched here (SEALED_PATH_RULES).
research/answer-keys/
research/datasets/*/test.jsonl
research/datasets/qa-trace-sft-v0/baseline-results.json
research/datasets/qa-trace-sft-v0/harness-v2-results.json
research/datasets/qa-trace-sft-v0/harness-v3-results.json
research/datasets/seeker-sft-v1/quarantined.jsonl
research/datasets/seeker-sft-v1/source_manifests.json
